{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17080","headline":"九日小园独谣赠门下武相公 · 李吉甫","name":"九日小园独谣赠门下武相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小园休沐暇，暂与故山期。\n树杪悬丹枣，苔阴落紫梨。\n舞丛新菊徧，绕格古藤垂。\n受露红兰晚，迎霜白薤肥。\n上公留凤沼，冠劒侍清祠。\n应念端居者，长慙补衮诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李吉甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17080.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17080","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}